png/w4bIWyNFlc9a6YKTfIicdyzjd05GwbEMrbTua2Wo3JNBzdwHSwbAia0yfKaEzGgT46ZdzJMwNbkwxEYRGplcEOZg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span>国旗护卫队入场</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9a6YKTfIicdyzjd05GwbEMrTon5NgMsONBjlZKv2Xc4hfYuKvTHl2bV0pTgQthoflKhDhMqSLt1ibw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>奏唱国歌、校歌，全场合唱并行注目礼</span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9a6YKTfIicdyzjd05GwbEMrrHjxfxZNYl9QJ6bRb1VWiabWkrysf7s58L5yCOKE2PYoRWXPjvkSZBw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9a6YKTfIicdyzjd05GwbEMr0bMNIkdCzvOpbnyibVexFIguFfL0wHBYSyqIPcvmZ8fBicKHyoX7lOfA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>运动员方阵入场</span></p><p><span>本次田径运动会为期两天，由华南农业大学体育运动委员会、体育教学研究部主办，园艺学院承办，共有来自全校各学院近3800名师生参会。校党委书记李凤亮，校长薛红卫，校党委副书记丁红星，副校长杨运东、钟强，学校体委会成员、各学院相关负责人等出席开幕式。</span></p><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9a6YKTfIicdyzjd05GwbEMrSIDhgEibicRr18urkS0cQeOh5lIanZUJgHd8ATYicHOndTOg5s0JaptNQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><section><span>校党委书记李凤亮宣布运动会正式开幕</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9a6YKTfIicdyzjd05GwbEMrLvUKrHicXwMd1aYiarwudyoVA6QRKC8s6liaxhN0pPJ6UIPVy74jRT5Rg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>校长薛红卫致开幕辞</span></p><section><span><span>薛红卫在开幕致辞中表示，<span>高质量的体育教育工作是培养一流人才的重要一环。</span></span>近年来，学校持续深化体育教育教学改革，学生整体体质健康水平不断提升，竞技体育节节攀高。2024年，华农健儿在各项国家级、省级锦标赛中获奖近百项，冠军队伍数量增至10个。<span>新体育馆等硬件设施的投入使用，也</span>为学校体育教学和师生锻炼提供了更优质的硬件环境。<span>希望师生以校运会为契机，锻炼强健体魄、磨砺坚定意志，为学校“双一流”建设继续努力奋斗。</span></span></section></section><section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9a6YKTfIicdyzjd05GwbEMrg6LstdgNaYEkRye1nrGCktUdwZH6HXNL9XWMfPp15zria8Mg1vDx48w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>主席台嘉宾为学生阳光体育运动先进集体颁奖</span></p></section><section><section><span>钟强宣读了《关于表彰华南农业大学2023—2024学年学生阳光体育运动先进集体及个人的决定》。主席台嘉宾为获得学生阳光体育运动先进集体的8个学院颁奖。体育教学研究部老师宋明伟和园艺学院学生林朝晖分别<span>代表</span>裁判员和运动员宣誓。</span></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9a6YKTfIicdyzjd05GwbEMrHFh5kAgqzujkZIruzGkFoYVULeMqUXo6YZKNVhTNevYGcE2VzGiaZ3A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9a6YKTfIicdyzjd05GwbEMr6vDNOHpafptXwdVVnOTuCjcCOYpa0T45SEntGz4ImhaqdROFb7bNhg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><section><span>广播体操比赛</span></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9a6YKTfIicdyzjd05GwbEMr4Z9bRibaotslZu94HqFCGGKrgGSzNZ9XiaClqc2lJFRBGHOXcUBK75bA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9a6YKTfIicdyzjd05GwbEMriakibn0GbhN03NQCwyyPKjqJEdoddfSrJHibK76N88fhciasjh7WnhqaicA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9a6YKTfIicdyzjd05GwbEMrufzOJpvDWH2QhIic5hZ6FB6RPbxZjCZI0CWiaTPMdajMhp8KfuW9cqYA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9a6YKTfIicdyzjd05GwbEMrsXrHq1rpa0NkUn7gjic7PKhEFUeia2ByzlV3M50f1AErErvt1XRhYr5w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9a6YKTfIicdyzjd05GwbEMrCofapNQzZpnxrwkGto5qLEl6icwiaFIWnxVMppRPunEza94Xib2iaQTxicA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9a6YKTfIicdyzjd05GwbEMrFoVvPJYicDibReucMjP1zGeEc2cIvE3XHibWzg7pScxxiaDkdChNC8pPOQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>开幕式文体表演</span></p><section><span>广播体操比赛中，各学院方阵队动作整齐划一，展现了积极向上的学子面貌。开幕式文体表演则以“‘园’梦未来”为主题，采用大型情景表演歌舞编创手法，通过队形变化组成不同主题图案，并融入颇具园艺学科特色的舞蹈表演，展现华农学子坚韧不拔的拼搏英姿，表达对农业科学发展、乡村全面振兴的美好未来愿景。</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9a6YKTfIicdyzjd05GwbEMr0FicicUFibmMmIiaXTGZpVDRIJkKhXELiaOu542jMPfnD0BUZM2kqZ3trdw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>展板</span></p><p><span>“今年开幕式的氛围很好，参与开幕式的师生数量比往年有所增加，各单位通力合作，力求做好<span>赛事</span>全面保障。”本届校运会的总裁判长于江杨告诉记者，本届校运会优化了赛程安排，加强了场地保障和培训工作。</span></p><p><span>今年是华南农业大学办学115周年，本届运动会还特别设置了“历史回眸”“砥砺前行” “争创一流”“冠军时刻”四块体育文化展板，展示校史上的体育大事、赛事精彩瞬间和荣耀时刻，和师生一起穿越时光，追忆往昔、展望未来。</span><br/></p><p><span>竞技场上，神采飞扬</span></p><p><span>青春热血，赛场驰骋</span></p><p><span>跟着新禾记者镜头<br/></span></p><section><span>直击校运会赛场！</span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibCaUj7FzbXCpUG0kYAHhLsujM4b1rxHb1jvIb9dT2bhsjKGCibONmxvezSS3T5oXT7It6eCEDFSgQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong>开赛！健儿英姿，精彩瞬间</strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><stro